Hello {!relatedTo.Owner.Manager.Name},<br /><br />
The following opportunities under your team have remained without updates for more than 14 days after an SLA breach in the Sales CRM.<br/>
To ensure visibility and progress, please review the list below and work with the corresponding sellers to take the necessary action. If a listed seller is inactive, please help update the opportunity with the appropriate owner.
<br /><br />
Opportunities Requiring Attention:
[REQUIRED_FIELDS]

<br /><br />
You can view all opportunities currently breaching SLAs in the following report: <a href="[REPORT_LINK]">Report Link</a><br/>
This is a visibility summary to support data quality and ensure timely updates across your team’s pipeline <br /><br />
Sales Excellence 

</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>